.el .ds Aq '
.TH wx-alerts 1  "alerts " 
.SH NAME
wx\-alerts \- Active National Weather Service alerts (US only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwx alerts\fR [\fB\-\-only\-if\-any\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPLACE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Active National Weather Service alerts (US only)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-only\-if\-any\fR
Announce nothing when no alerts are in effect, instead of saying so
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPLACE\fR>
A station (KSJC), latitude,longitude, US street address or place name ("Mountain View, CA"); quotes are optional
